      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wisner%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Wisner was incorporated in 1903, solidifying its status as a formal town.",
